es with keywords Revitalisation, Moisture, Firmness."},{"t":"11.4-14.1","beat":"montage","note":"Particle burst and light flare lead back to the vial."},{"t":"14.1-16.0","beat":"end-card","note":"Vial on hex stage then brand wordmark on red."}],"shot_labels":[{"shot":1,"scale":"wide","beat":"hook","note":"Dark vial, glow flares on, push-in"},{"shot":2,"scale":"macro","beat":"reveal","note":"Whip into label type, push-in"},{"shot":3,"scale":"macro","beat":"macro","note":"Label molecule drawing, push-in"},{"shot":4,"scale":"macro","beat":"macro","note":"Pull-out across label"},{"shot":5,"scale":"close","beat":"hero","note":"Vial cap and shoulder, pull-out"},{"shot":6,"scale":"close","beat":"hero","note":"Tilted vial label, push-in"},{"shot":7,"scale":"close","beat":"transition","note":"Vial tumbles, push-in"},{"shot":8,"scale":"macro","beat":"montage","note":"Red liquid swirl, keyword one"},{"shot":9,"scale":"macro","beat":"montage","note":"Bubbles close, keyword"},{"shot":10,"scale":"macro","beat":"montage","note":"Pull-out bubbles, keyword two"},{"shot":11,"scale":"macro","beat":"montage","note":"Bubble swell, keyword three"},{"shot":12,"scale":"macro","beat":"montage","note":"Particles blast, pull-out"},{"shot":13,"scale":"medium","beat":"end-card","note":"Vial on hex stage, lockup, held"}],"learn":["Hold a single colour (deep red) across all 13 shots for full brand unity.","Begin with a dark vial and push into label detail at 1-1.5s per shot.","Name each benefit with one short keyword on a 1.2-1.4s macro of bubbles.","Whip from macro to full product reveal in a flash transition near 13s.","End on a 2s held lockup: product, tagline, wordmark."]},"shots":[{"idx":1,"start_s":0,"end_s":1.12,"dur_s":1.12,"enters_via":"start","move":"dolly-zoom (vertigo) candidate + push-in + pan left (content moves left) + handheld","ease":"easeIn (accelerating)","zoom_pct":15.33,"pan_pct":-27.34,"tilt_pct":11.46,"jitter":1.31,"luma":0.037,"contrast":0.049,"saturation":0.967,"warmth":6